0..57 Comment "//! This record type holds the components of `Model(LC)`."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..136 Comment "//! The derivation fixes the order of fields. The fields include contexts,"
137..183 Comment "//! substitutions, terms, operations and laws."
184..187 Comment "//!"
188..263 Comment "//! Component indices use the order of their source sorts. The syntax model"
264..329 Comment "//! packs into this record. Beta reduction uses one substitution."
330..333 Comment "//!"
334..349 Comment "//! - see: #640"
351..412 Comment "// This source imports naturals, syntax and the syntax model."
